  "releaseNotes": "### v1.0.0 Highlights\n      - Full ADO.NET adapter layer wrapping `Microsoft.Data.SqlClient`\n      - `SqlServerConnection` with automatic connection lifecycle management\n      - `SqlServerUnitOfWork` for transactional grouping\n      - One-call DI registration via `AddActiveForgeSqlServer()` extension method\n      - Pessimistic locking support.",
